{
  "title": "QuickSight / Quick Sight · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "여러 데이터 소스를 연결해 시각화하고 대시보드로 공유합니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>QuickSight / Quick Sight</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#guide-1\">데이터에서 대시보드까지</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#guide-2\">데이터를 읽는 방식</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>분석</span><span>37 / 62</span></div><h1>QuickSight / Quick Sight</h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>QuickSight(Quick Sight)는 <strong>데이터를 차트와 대시보드로 만들어 공유하는 비즈니스 인텔리전스<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup> 기능</strong>입니다. 분석할 데이터를 연결하고 필요한 지표를 시각화할 수 있습니다.</p><p>데이터베이스나 분석 서비스 등의 데이터를 연결하고, 집계와 차트를 구성해 사용자가 지표를 확인하도록 제공합니다. 원본 데이터의 저장과 분석 화면의 공유는 각각 설계합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"comparison\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"amazon-quick-and-quick-sight\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"data-sources-and-datasets\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"spice\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"direct-query\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"refresh-schedules-and-incremental-refresh\"></span><h2>데이터에서 대시보드까지</h2><p>데이터 소스를 연결하고 분석할 데이터셋을 준비합니다. 열을 정리하고 계산 항목을 만든 뒤 차트와 표로 시각화합니다.</p><p>분석을 대시보드로 게시해 사용자와 공유합니다. 사용자별로 볼 수 있는 행이나 열을 제한하고, 애플리케이션 안에 분석 화면을 포함하는 구성도 가능합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"data-preparation-and-calculated-fields\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"analyses-sheets-and-visuals\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"dashboards-and-sharing\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"row-level-and-column-level-security\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"private-vpc-connections-and-permissions\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"embedded-analytics\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"natural-language-and-related-services\"></span><h2>데이터를 읽는 방식</h2><p><strong>SPICE</strong>는 데이터를 분석용 메모리 엔진으로 가져와 빠르게 조회하는 방식입니다. 데이터 갱신 주기와 필요한 용량을 정합니다.</p><p><strong>직접 쿼리</strong>는 조회할 때 원본 데이터 소스에 요청합니다. 데이터의 최신성이 얼마나 중요한지, 원본 DB가 감당할 부하가 어느 정도인지에 따라 선택합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>대시보드 작성 흐름</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>데이터 연결</strong><span>DB·분석 서비스 등</span></li><li><strong>데이터셋 준비</strong><span>정리·집계·갱신</span></li><li><strong>시각화·공유</strong><span>사용자별 대시보드</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">분석 화면의 응답 속도와 원본 데이터 갱신 주기를 함께 정합니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>각 지점의 매출 데이터를 집계해 대시보드를 만들고, 지점 담당자는 자신의 지점 데이터만 볼 수 있도록 행 수준 접근 제한을 적용합니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>비즈니스 인텔리전스</strong> — 업무 데이터를 분석해 의사결정에 필요한 지표와 시각화로 제공하는 방식입니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/quick/latest/userguide/what-is.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What is Amazon Quick? ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-2\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/quick/latest/userguide/quick-bi.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Visualize, analyze, and share data with analyses, dashboards, and reports in Amazon Quick Sight ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-3\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/quick/latest/userguide/spice.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Importing data into SPICE ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-4\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/quick/latest/userguide/restrict-access-to-a-data-set-using-row-level-security.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Using row-level security with user-based rules to restrict access to a dataset ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q104/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q104\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q104\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q104</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q104/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company stores sales data in Amazon S3 and uses Amazon Athena to query it. Business analysts need interactive charts and dashboards that they can share with executives. Which AWS capability should they use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q104\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon Quick Sight (formerly Amazon QuickSight)</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q104\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS CloudTrail</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q104\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SQS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q104\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS DataSync</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · Athena로 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 데이터를 조회하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/\">Quick Sight</a>에서 이를 시각화해 대시보드를 게시·공유할 수 있다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/\">QuickSight / Quick Sight</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q105\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q105\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q105</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q105/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A frequently viewed dashboard queries an RDS data source. The company wants faster visualizations and fewer repeated queries against the source database. Which Quick Sight dataset mode is most appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q105\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Direct Query</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q105\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">SPICE</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q105\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS Snapshot</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q105\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SQS FIFO</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/\">SPICE</a>는 데이터를 메모리 기반 엔진에 가져와 반복적인 분석 쿼리를 빠르게 처리한다. 원본의 변경 사항은 데이터 세트 새로 고침으로 반영한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/\">QuickSight / Quick Sight</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q106\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q106\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q106</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q106/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A Quick Sight dashboard must query the underlying database when viewers open or interact with it, rather than rely on a periodically refreshed imported copy. Which dataset mode should the architect select?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q106\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">SPICE</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q106\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier Deep Archive</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q106\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Direct Query</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q106\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Backup</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/\">Direct Query</a>는 대시보드를 사용할 때 원본 데이터 소스를 조회한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/\">SPICE</a>는 가져온 데이터의 새로 고침이 필요하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/\">QuickSight / Quick Sight</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q107\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q107\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q107</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q107/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An analyst has finished creating charts in a Quick Sight analysis and wants to give business users a shared, interactive view without granting them permission to edit the analysis. What should the analyst publish?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q107\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An Amazon Machine Image</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q107\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A dashboard</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q107\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A VPC route table</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q107\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS volume</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · 분석(<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#analyses-sheets-and-visuals\">analysis</a>)을 대시보드로 게시해 사용자 또는 그룹에 공유한다. 대시보드 열람자는 필터 등으로 상호작용할 수 있지만 원본 분석을 직접 편집하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/\">QuickSight / Quick Sight</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q108\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q108\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q108</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q108/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company shares the same Quick Sight dashboard with regional managers, but each manager must see only the rows for their own region. Which feature meets this requirement?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q108\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A Network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q108\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon CloudFront caching</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q108\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Row-level security (RLS) on the dataset</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q108\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">EC2 placement groups</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/\">Quick Sight</a>의 행 수준 보안(<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/#row-level-and-column-level-security\">RLS</a>)은 데이터 세트에서 사용자 또는 그룹에 따라 보이는 행을 제한한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/\">QuickSight / Quick Sight</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/\">이전 용어 <b>Placement Group</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">다음 용어 <b>RDS</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
